{"id":"zhestoko","lemma":"жестоко","pos":"adv","rank":1701,"glosses":["hard, harshly, sorely, violently, foully, sore, sharply"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/05/Ru-%D0%B6%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B6%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это было жестоко.","en":"It was cruel.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Том был жестоко убит.","en":"Tom was brutally murdered.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"Я был жестоко избит.","en":"I was badly beaten.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"С его стороны было жестоко сказать ей такое.","en":"It was cruel of him to say such things to her.","words":[{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"side, hand, party","l":"сторона"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"to say, to tell"},{"g":"(to) her"},{"g":"something like that"}]},{"text":"Чувствую себя жестоко обманутым.","en":"I feel so betrayed.","words":[{"g":"to feel","l":"чувствовать"},{"g":"oneself"},null,null]}]}